# Purpose

This document defines the Dyeing & Printing Intelligence Engine used by FCOS Enterprise.

Its purpose is to identify, normalize, classify, and describe all textile dyeing and printing techniques used across women's wear, men's wear, kids' wear, jewellery accessories, ethnic wear, indo-western wear, and western wear.

Dyeing & Printing is independent of:

• Fabric
• Work Detail
• Construction
• Silhouette
• Textile Finish

Evidence Hierarchy

1. Excel
2. Catalog Description
3. Visual AI
4. Fashion Reasoning

Visual AI may determine Dyeing or Printing only when higher-priority evidence is unavailable.

---

# Definition

Dyeing

The process of colouring textile fibres, yarns, fabrics, or garments.

Printing

The process of applying decorative designs, motifs, or colours onto textile surfaces.

